  "notes": [
    "Bg is warm paper, not white, because the map is paper too and a white panel fights it.",
    "Accent is forest, the only saturated colour in a resting view. Marigold is reserved for the fixes layer and busy markers, never decoration.",
    "Chips carry the category colour as a dot only, so a chip stays readable in every theme.",
    "Body text is 14px Inter, place titles are Fraunces 26 to 34px. The serif is the whole identity, do not use it for UI labels.",
    "Focus rings are 2px accent with 2px offset, and the contrast theme makes them black."
